## Việc chưa làm được
- Không có. Tất cả yêu cầu backend, web UI, retry API, git verification, cache invalidation, cursor pagination, và audit feedback đều đã hoàn thành và kiểm tra đạt 100%.

## Danh sách commit trên nhánh
- `ef0255c0` fix(api): correct non-integration merge target verification and restrict 409 conflict classification
- `4687fd5a` Merge branch 'agenthub/integration' into agenthub/t-flow-merge-push-failed-nodes
- `89c4d12b` fix(api): preserve original error codes and avoid reporting conflict on retry check failures
- `defb19ec` fix(api): determine push failure timestamp independently and avoid using task.updatedAt
- `d4b92fa1` fix(api): safely guard scheduler eventBus registration in AppService constructor
- `35f048b8` fix(api): fix git check cache invalidation for delivery issues
- `7f73c530` fix(web): add statusTime translations and fallback labels for merge_failed and push_failed
- `59b26548` fix(api): restrict merge target verification to actual target branch
- `952a4e8c` fix(api): fix git pushed verification, success event clearance and derived cursor pagination
